"响度的大小取决于发声体振动的振幅","bbox":[807.512,160.953,239.524,14.97],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0017","science-p008-n0018","science-p008-n0019"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0010","text":"【知识延伸】声音性质表现","bbox":[389.281,234.869,89.822,37.425],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0020","science-p008-n0021"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0011","text":"闻其声而知其人，原因在于每个人的音色不同","bbox":[514.656,214.284,299.405,14.97],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0022"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0012","text":"男高音、男中音、男低音的核心区别在于音调不同","bbox":[514.656,257.324,329.346,14.97],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0023"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0013","text":"震耳欲聋形容的是声音的响度很大","bbox":[514.656,300.363,224.554,14.97],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0024"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0014","text":"声音传播","bbox":[389.281,375.215,59.881,14.97],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0025"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0015","text":"声音的传播需要介质。在真空中，声音不能传播","bbox":[484.716,353.695,314.376,15.24],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0026","science-p008-n0027"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0016","text":"常温下，声音在不同的介质中传播的速度不同，通常固体＞液体＞气体，且在金属介质中传播更快","bbox":[484.716,396.734,643.721,15.24],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0028","science-p008-n0029","science-p008-n0030","science-p008-n0031","science-p008-n0032"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0017","text":"声音分类","bbox":[389.281,591.348,59.881,14.97],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0033"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0018","text":"根据声音的频率，分为人耳可听声及超出听觉范围的声音","bbox":[484.716,439.774,374.256,14.97],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0034"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0019","text":"①可听声：频率在20Hz~20kHz之间的声波，是人耳可以感知的","bbox":[484.716,477.21,422.413,20.573],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0035","science-p008-n0036","science-p008-n0037","science-p008-n0038"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0020","text":"②超声波：频率高于","bbox":[484.716,546.437,134.733,14.97],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0039","science-p008-n0040","science-p008-n0041"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0021","text":"20kHz的声波","bbox":[507.478,563.289,89.208,20.573],"nodeIds":["science-p008-n0042","science-p008-n0043"]},{"id":"science-p008-b0022","text":"优点：方向性好，能量集中，对固体和液体穿透力强","bbox":[655.003,525.8